#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:518
msgid ""
"A short string identifier to be displayed in the /state handle.<br />It must "
"satisfy regexp ^[a-zA-Z0-9./+_-]*$. Default: an empty string"
msgstr ""
"要在 /state 句柄中显示的短字符串标识符。<br />它必须满足正则表达"
"式 ^[a-zA-Z0-9./+_-]*$。默认值：空字符串"

