msgid ""
"Changing this parameter may increase the performance. Or not.<br />See "
"kernel documentation. Default: MMAP"
msgstr ""
"更改此参数可能会提高性能，也可能不会。<br />请参阅内核文档。"
"默认值：MMAP"

