#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:597
#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:644
msgid "Sink permissions"
msgstr "Sink 权限"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:240
msgid "Slowdown"
msgstr "放缓"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:241
msgid ""
"Slowdown capturing to 1 FPS or less when no stream or sink clients are "
"connected.<br />Useful to reduce CPU consumption. Default: disabled"
msgstr ""
"当没有流或接收端客户端连接时，将捕获速度降低至1帧/秒或更低。<br />有助于降"
"低CPU消耗。默认：禁用"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:144
msgid "Stream unavailable"
msgstr "流不可用"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:441
msgid "TCP no delay"
msgstr "TCP 无延迟"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:382
msgid ""
"The number of buffers to receive data from the device.<br />Each buffer may "
"be processed using an independent thread.<br />Default: 3 (the number of CPU "
"cores (but not more than 4) + 1)"
msgstr ""
"用于接收设备数据的缓冲区数量。<br />每个缓冲区可通过独立线程进行处理。<br />默认"
"值：3（CPU核心数（但不超过4）+ 1）"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:393
msgid ""
"The number of worker threads but not more than buffers.<br />Default: 2 (the "
"number of CPU cores (but not more than 4))"
msgstr "工作线程数，但不超过缓冲区数量。<br />默认值：2（即 CPU 核心数，但不超过4）"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:527
msgid "Timeout for client connections. Default: 10 seconds"
msgstr "客户端连接超时。默认值：10秒"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:198
msgid "Timeout for device querying. Default: 1 second"
msgstr "设备查询超时。默认值：1秒"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:568
#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:615
#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:662
msgid "Timeout for lock"
msgstr "锁定超时"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:467
msgid "Try to remove old UNIX socket file before binding. Default: disabled"
msgstr "尝试在绑定前删除旧的 UNIX 套接字文件。默认：禁用"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:457
msgid "UNIX socket"
msgstr "UNIX 套接字"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:476
msgid "UNIX socket permissions"
msgstr "UNIX 套接字权限"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:466
msgid "UNIX socket remove old"
msgstr "UNIX 套接字移除旧项"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:265
msgid ""
"Use specified encoder. It may affect the number of workers<br /><li><kbd>CPU "
"──────── </kbd>Software MJPEG encoding (default)</li><li><kbd>HW ───────── </"
"kbd>Use pre-encoded MJPEG frames directly from camera hardware</"
"li><li><kbd>M2M-VIDEO ── </kbd>GPU-accelerated MJPEG encoding using V4L2 M2M "
"video interface</li><li><kbd>M2M-IMAGE ── </kbd>GPU-accelerated JPEG "
"encoding using V4L2 M2M image interface</li>"
msgstr ""
"使用指定编码器。这可能影响工作进程数量<br /><li><kbd>CPU ──────── </kbd>软件"
" MJPEG 编码（默认）</li><li><kbd>硬件 ──────── </kbd>直接使用摄像头硬件预编码"
"的 MJPEG 帧</li><li><kbd>M2M-VIDEO ── </kbd>通过 V4L2 M2M 视频接口实现GPU加速的"
" MJPEG 编码</li><li><kbd>M2M-IMAGE ── </kbd>通过 V4L2 M2M 图像接口实现GPU加速的"
" JPEG 编码</li>"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:635
msgid ""
"Use the shared memory to sink H264 frames. Default: disabled<br />The name "
"should end with a suffix .h264"
msgstr "使用共享内存来接收 H264 帧。默认：禁用<br />文件名应以 .h264 后缀结尾"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:541
msgid ""
"Use the shared memory to sink JPEG frames. Default: disabled<br />The name "
"should end with a suffix .jpg or .jpeg"
msgstr "使用共享内存来接收 JPEG 帧。默认：禁用<br />文件名应以 .jpg 或 .jpeg 后缀结尾"

#: applications/luci-app-ustreamer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ustreamer/ustreamer.js:588
msgid ""
"Use the shared memory to sink RAW frames. Default: disabled<br />The name "
"should end with a suffix .raw"
msgstr "使用共享内存接收原始帧。默认：禁用<br />文件名应以 .raw 后缀结尾"

